 and b shoot lightning  bolts out of his fingies like palpatine  from hell later on the hood can even  transform robins into a full-blown demon  during the events of civil war in the  comics he creates his own super  organized crime syndicate and wilson  fist aka kingpin's absence often duking  it out with the new avengers in new  avengers number 46 set during the skrull  invasion parker finally learns that the  power behind his cape is dormammu ruler  of the dark dimension during the events  of the dark rain norman osborne recruits  the hood in his crime syndicate to  protect osborne's avengers from the new  avengers attacks and parker uses  dormammu's powers to resurrect a team of  dead villains to help stop the punisher  from killing osborne dormammu later  empowers the hood with enough magic to  hunt down doctor strange and kill him  allowing him to become the next sorcerer  supreme parker fails to capture strange  but i'm personally fascinated by  parker's allegiance to dormammu she-hulk  season is upon us is it okay to say  she-hulk she's in i'm just gonna say it  she-hulk she's in  if you're green with envy for marvel's  newest attorney epic hero shop.com has  you covered latest obsession number 19  lady justice is available in the shop  for a limited time and if that's not  enough for you epic hero shop's got a  girl boss shirt in a font that maybe  fans of she-hulk will recognize but i  think that what we all love about  she-hulk isn't just the ability to  boldly forge novel legal precedents in  the name of justice or her perfect green  skin it's that in a lot of ways she's  the personification of justice itself  that's what the superhuman law division  t is all about justice is jacked these  designs would be rad if they were on  posters but you get to wear them yes and  trust me epic hero shop stuff is comfy  as hell regular rotation for sure this  is absolutely the best way to support  the channel and wearing the merch is the  best way to spot fans in the wild so  make sure to wear it to avengers campus  conventions and opening weekend also be  sure to tag epic hero shop and use  real epic hero to get featured on their  page get everything you need to be the  stylish nerd you know you are at  epicheroshop.com  tis the season as the hood's powers are  connected to interdimensional mystic  arts in the comics i think it could be  really interesting to see him go up  against iron hearts tech in the upcoming  series and after seeing dominique thorne  and shuri's lab in the wakanda forever  trailer we now know that she has access  to some of the most cutting-edge tech in  the entire world in the comics she  attends mit at only 15 years old  connects with tony stark and ends up  building her own iron heart suit so  skipping straight to shuri's lab is a  major upgrade in my opinion mit is great  don't get me wrong they just don't have  cool giant battle rhinos roaming around  their campus and this lab does as she  comes into her own as iron heart it'll  be really cool to actually see her fight  head to head with a magic wielder with  her souped up tech although tony stark  got in plenty of wizard jabs about  doctor strange and tussled with the  infinity stones before he died his solo  films never really focused on battling  the mystic arts i'm stoked to see riri  williams become her own unique hero  outside of tony's immediate influence  facing a variety of opponents and  accessing new tech that tony never got  the chance to and that's where the hood  might come in if riri has access to  vibranium wakandan tech or even some of  the pymtek we've seen pop up so far in  phase four parker robbins and his  organized crime ring might want to get  their hands on it i have a feeling the  hood won't be the one pulling the  strings at first when he debuts because  the escalation of robin's ambitions is  what makes the character so interesting  on the page like i mentioned a second  ago the hood did work as a hired gun in  several of 